        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Unintended Obscurity",
            "block_bbox": [
                79,
                116,
                326,
                144
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 1,
            "group_id": 2,
            "global_block_id": 2,
            "global_group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    79.0,
                    116.0
                ],
                [
                    326.0,
                    116.0
                ],
                [
                    326.0,
                    144.0
                ],
                [
                    79.0,
                    144.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Those who write in ways that seem dense and convoluted rarely intend to do so. It is unlikely that the writers of this next passage knowingly wrote it as unclearly as they did:",
            "block_bbox": [
                79,
                151,
                772,
                204
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 3,
            "global_block_id": 3,
            "global_group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    79.0,
                    151.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    151.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    204.0
                ],
                [
                    79.0,
                    204.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "A major condition affecting adult reliance on early communicative patterns is the extent to which the communication has been planned prior to its delivery. We find that adult speech behaviour takes on many of the characteristics of child language, where the communication is spontaneous and relatively unpredictable.",
            "block_bbox": [
                113,
                216,
                742,
                316
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 4,
            "global_block_id": 4,
            "global_group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    113.0,
                    216.0
                ],
                [
                    742.0,
                    216.0
                ],
                [
                    742.0,
                    316.0
                ],
                [
                    113.0,
                    316.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "—E. Ochs and B. Schieffelin, Planned and Unplanned Discourse",
            "block_bbox": [
                255,
                328,
                743,
                352
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 5,
            "global_block_id": 5,
            "global_group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    255.0,
                    328.0
                ],
                [
                    743.0,
                    328.0
                ],
                [
                    743.0,
                    352.0
                ],
                [
                    255.0,
                    352.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "That means (we think):",
            "block_bbox": [
                80,
                366,
                282,
                389
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 6,
            "global_block_id": 6,
            "global_group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    80.0,
                    366.0
                ],
                [
                    282.0,
                    366.0
                ],
                [
                    282.0,
                    389.0
                ],
                [
                    80.0,
                    389.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "When we speak spontaneously, we rely on patterns of child language.",
            "block_bbox": [
                79,
                402,
                655,
                428
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 7,
            "global_block_id": 7,
            "global_group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    79.0,
                    402.0
                ],
                [
                    655.0,
                    402.0
                ],
                [
                    655.0,
                    428.0
                ],
                [
                    79.0,
                    428.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The authors might object that our paraphrase oversimplifies their idea, but those eleven words express what we take from their forty-seven. And what really counts, after all, is not what writers think they have put into a passage but what readers get out of it.",
            "block_bbox": [
                78,
                441,
                772,
                543
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 8,
            "global_block_id": 8,
            "global_group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    78.0,
                    441.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    441.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    543.0
                ],
                [
                    78.0,
                    543.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The ethical issue here is not those writers' willful indifference but their innocent ignorance. We can help such writers by reading carefully and charitably. And if we have the opportunity, we can help them by telling them candidly how their writing affects us—and why. We know many of you right now think you do not have the standing to do that. But one day you will.",
            "block_bbox": [
                78,
                546,
                773,
                675
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 9,
            "global_block_id": 9,
            "global_group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    78.0,
                    546.0
                ],
                [
                    773.0,
                    546.0
                ],
                [
                    773.0,
                    675.0
                ],
                [
                    78.0,
                    675.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Intended Misdirection",
            "block_bbox": [
                79,
                695,
                324,
                720
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 10,
            "global_block_id": 10,
            "global_group_id": 10,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    79.0,
                    695.0
                ],
                [
                    324.0,
                    695.0
                ],
                [
                    324.0,
                    720.0
                ],
                [
                    79.0,
                    720.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Not all obscurity is unintentional: it can arise also when writers knowingly put other interests over those of their readers. We might take a hard line and condemn writers who adopt anything but the most straightforward style. But not all indirectness is unethical. When a supervisor says I'm afraid our new funding didn't come through, we know it means You have lost your job. That indirectness is motivated not by dishonesty but by kindness, and few would condemn the supervisor for it. But what about cases in which such stylistic misdirection reflects not writers' compassion but a genuine difference between their interests and those of their readers? These examples challenge you to consider that important question.",
            "block_bbox": [
                78,
                729,
                772,
                964
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 10,
            "group_id": 11,
            "global_block_id": 11,
            "global_group_id": 11,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    78.0,
                    729.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    729.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    964.0
                ],
                [
                    78.0,
                    964.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Who Erred? A major automotive repair company was once accused of over-charging its customers. It responded with this notice:",
            "block_bbox": [
                79,
                976,
                772,
                1027
            ],
            "block_id": 12,
            "block_order": 11,
            "group_id": 12,
            "global_block_id": 12,
            "global_group_id": 12,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    79.0,
                    976.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    976.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    1027.0
                ],
                [
                    79.0,
                    1027.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "With over two million automotive customers serviced last year in California alone, mistakes may have occurred. However, we want you to know that we would never intentionally violate the trust customers have shown in our company for more than 100 years.",
            "block_bbox": [
                114,
                1039,
                743,
                1138
            ],
            "block_id": 13,
            "block_order": 12,
            "group_id": 13,
            "global_block_id": 13,
            "global_group_id": 13,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    114.0,
                    1039.0
                ],
                [
                    743.0,
                    1039.0
                ],
                [
                    743.0,
                    1138.0
                ],
                [
                    114.0,
                    1138.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In the first sentence, the writer avoided identifying the company as the party responsible for mistakes. The writer could have used a passive verb:",
            "block_bbox": [
                78,
                1152,
                771,
                1204
            ],
            "block_id": 14,
            "block_order": 13,
            "group_id": 14,
            "global_block_id": 14,
            "global_group_id": 14,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    78.0,
                    1152.0
                ],
                [
                    771.0,
                    1152.0
                ],
                [
                    771.0,
                    1204.0
                ],
                [
                    78.0,
                    1204.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "...mistakes may have been made.",
